Z||000006||Oreif||11-25-2000||08:39 PM||||I bought my entire suspension kit at the Fiero Store. Rins about $650.00 (with 10% discount). It is Eibach Springs, KYB shocks/struts, KONI sway Bars, And poly bushings. This lowers the car about 1.5" I am using 15" GT style wheels with 225/50R15 tires all the way around.<BR> <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/86SE_2.jpg">   <P><BR>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">   <P><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 11-25-2000).]||||reg||1
